<Legal
  title="Risk Warning | Pocket Option"
  description="Trading financial instruments on Pocket Option involves significant risk. Read this risk warning before you deposit."
  h1="Risk warning"
  lead="Trading is risky. Please read this before you open a real account or make a deposit."
  crumb="Risk warning"
>
  <p>
    <strong>
      Trading financial instruments, including fixed-time trades, forex, cryptocurrencies, stocks and commodities,
      involves significant risk and can result in the loss of all the money you invest.
    </strong>
  </p>
  <h2>What this means in practice</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Most short-term traders lose money.</li>
    <li>Past results, including demo results, do not guarantee future returns.</li>
    <li>Bonuses come with conditions that can limit withdrawals.</li>
    <li>Offshore brokers offer less protection than regulated ones, with no investor compensation scheme.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Before you trade</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Only trade with money you can afford to lose.</li>
    <li>
      Practise on the <a href="/demo-account/">demo account</a> first.
    </li>
    <li>Set a budget and a daily loss limit, and stick to them.</li>
    <li>Seek independent financial advice if you are unsure.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Help with gambling-like behaviour</h2>
  <p>
    If trading stops being a controlled activity, take a break and talk to someone you trust or a local support service.
  </p>
</Legal>
